# PID Control Function Block Diagram Documentation

## Function Block: PID_Control

### Inputs
- **Enable**: BOOL - Enable PID control
- **Setpoint**: REAL - Process setpoint
- **ProcessValue**: REAL - Actual process value
- **Manual**: BOOL - Manual mode
- **ManualOutput**: REAL - Manual output value

### Outputs
- **Output**: REAL - Control output
- **Error**: REAL - Error signal (Setpoint - ProcessValue)
- **Active**: BOOL - PID active status

### Parameters
- **Kp**: REAL - Proportional gain
- **Ki**: REAL - Integral gain
- **Kd**: REAL - Derivative gain
- **Ti**: REAL - Integral time
- **Td**: REAL - Derivative time

## Block Diagram Structure
```
          +-------+     +-------+     +-------+
Setpoint ->| Error |---->|  P    |     |       |
          +-------+     +-------+     |       |
                                      |  Sum  |---> Output
ProcessValue ->| Invert |------------>|       |
               +--------+     +-------+|       |
                              +-------+|       |
                              |  I    |--------+
                              +-------+
                              +-------+
                              |  D    |
                              +-------+
```

## Description
This PID controller implements standard proportional-integral-derivative control:
- **P (Proportional)**: Responds to current error
- **I (Integral)**: Eliminates steady-state error
- **D (Derivative)**: Predicts future error based on rate of change

## Application Notes
- Tune Kp, Ki, Kd for specific process requirements
- Use manual mode for maintenance or testing
- Error signal calculated as: Error = Setpoint - ProcessValue
- Output limited to 0-100% unless otherwise configured

## Tags Used
- PID_Enable: BOOL - PID enable signal
- PID_Setpoint: REAL - Process setpoint
- PID_ProcessValue: REAL - Process variable feedback
- PID_Manual: BOOL - Manual mode select
- PID_ManualOutput: REAL - Manual output value
- PID_Output: REAL - Control output to actuator
- PID_Error: REAL - Error signal
- PID_Active: BOOL - PID active status
- PID_Kp: REAL - Proportional gain
- PID_Ki: REAL - Integral gain
- PID_Kd: REAL - Derivative gain
- PID_Ti: REAL - Integral time constant
- PID_Td: REAL - Derivative time constant
